{{!--
  Pathfinder 2e — ONE labelled line of a stat block.

      {{> stat-line for="front-price"}}

  The bold label is the place's caption from the card type's translations
  (`front-price-label: "Preis"`), the value follows on the same line with a
  hanging indent, so a wrapped line aligns under the first word after the
  label. The name arrives as the hash parameter `for` — not `slot`, which
  is the helper's own name. One line on purpose: the hull and its content
  share the line, so Handlebars keeps the caller's indentation.
--}}
{{#if (slot for)}}<div class="pf2e-stat-line"><span class="pf2e-stat-label">{{slot-label for}}</span>{{slot for}}</div>{{/if}}